1	// ============================================================
2	// Section — DATA
3	//
4	// Index / field inventory of the built-in engine. Every row on this
5	// page comes from a real endpoint the console serves:
6	//   GET /_xerj-console/api/v1/data-sources/connections
7	//   GET …/connections/built-in/indices          (names, docs, store bytes)
8	//   GET …/connections/built-in/indices/:i/fields (names, types)
9	// An unreachable engine yields empty tables and a line saying so — never
10	// sample clusters or seeded index names (data/data-sources.js is
11	// real-only). Sizes, per-dataset fields with coverage/examples and the
12	// capability strip live on CORPUS, the knowledge surface; this page is
13	// the flat inventory under it.
14	// ============================================================
